# Source and documentation are intentionally kept in the repository's Windows
# line ending convention. Marking them as text lets Git's whitespace checker
# treat the carriage return as an end-of-line marker instead of trailing data.
* text eol=crlf
# dd's vendored runtime, byte for byte; GitHub should not count it as this project's code
/dd.ps1 linguist-vendored
/.dd/** linguist-vendored
